    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "If we remain inveterate smokers, it is only because we have so often experienced the frustration that results from failure.",
      "translation": "如果我们依然是老烟民，那仅仅是因为我们经常经历失败带来的挫折感。",
