    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Most of us fail in our efforts at sel-improvement because our schemes are too ambitious and we never have time to carry them out.",
      "translation": "我们大多数人倾向于在自我改进的努力中失败，因为我们的计划太雄心勃勃了，且我们永远没有时间去执行它们。",
